  "live_records": {
    "q-95254": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95254",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
