    "q-95255": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95255",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int \\pi \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\pi \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\pi \\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\pi \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95255-a",
