    "q-95259": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95259",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int \\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x)=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\sqrt{2}\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{csch}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
