      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "$\\int 7\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t\\operatorname{sech}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sech}⁡t)=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡t\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡t\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡t+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 7\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t\\operatorname{sech}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t & =7\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡t\\operatorname{tanh}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =7(-\\operatorname{sech}⁡t)+C \\\\  & =-7\\operatorname{sech}⁡t+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
