    "q-96005": {
      "dom_id": "step-q96005",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "$\\int (\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta )\\text{d}\\theta =$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta )=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta +C,\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta )=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta )\\text{d}\\theta  & =\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{tanh}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta +\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{coth}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sech}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{csch}⁡\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96005-a",
