    "q-96004": {
      "dom_id": "step-q96004",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "$\\int (2\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y-9\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y)\\text{d}y=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sech}⁡y)=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y+C,\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{csch}⁡y)=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,⇒\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y-9\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y)\\text{d}y & =\\int 2\\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y+\\int (-9\\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{csch}⁡y\\operatorname{coth}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y-9\\int \\operatorname{sech}⁡y\\operatorname{tanh}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{csch}⁡y)-9(-\\operatorname{sech}⁡y)+C \\\\  & =9\\operatorname{sech}⁡y-2\\operatorname{csch}⁡y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
