    "q-96018": {
      "dom_id": "step-q96018",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "$$\n\n$\\int (3+2{sech}^{2}⁡w)\\,\\text{d}w=$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}w}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w)={sech}^{2}⁡w\\,⇒\\,\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w=\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3+2{sech}^{2}⁡w)\\,\\text{d}w & =\\int 3\\,\\text{d}w+\\int 2{sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3\\int \\,\\text{d}w+2\\int {sech}^{2}⁡w\\,\\text{d}w \\\\  & =3w+2\\operatorname{tanh}⁡w+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-96018-a",
